# Local linked worktrees are never part of the monorepo import
/.worktrees/

# What a conformance suite reports it ran (D640). Generated, never committed:
# a committed report is a claim about the corpus that a later corpus or a
# failing suite invalidates without touching the file, and `check-languages.mjs`
# would then read the previous run's answer and call it coverage. The suite
# writes one when it runs and CI generate-then-checks.
sdks/fixtures/results/

